      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>Bay Area Half, Thu 10/15. Lay it all out Wed night.</div><div><br/></div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>race shoes (plate) — 21 mi on them, fine</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>socks (the thin ones), shorts with gel pockets, singlet</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>bib + 4 pins (pick up Wed 4-7)</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>Garmin charged, set to auto-lap 1 mi, data page: lap pace / lap time / HR</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>2 gels + 1 caffeinated gel</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>throwaway long sleeve (old VT running club one) for the start corral</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>anti-chafe</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>post-race bag: dry shirt, sweats, recovery shake, phone charger</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>ride to the start booked for 5:55 (Owen + me)</div><div><en-todo checked="true"/>breakfast staged: bagel, PB, banana, coffee pods</div></en-note>]]>
    </content>
  </note>
